## 2. Hiện trạng (đã có)

### Kiến trúc view

```
MainView (~9k dòng main_view.py)
├── Grid: QListView IconMode + _GridCardDelegate (paint ~700 dòng/row path)
├── List: PipelineListRowView + PipelineListRowDelegate (plan_list_view_v2)
├── Model: PipelineTileModel + PipelineListModel → shared _all_items
├── Thumb: ThumbnailManager (async worker) + prefetch chunk 48 rows
└── Badge: QPainter custom (không QLabel trên card) — pipeline_row_paint.py helpers
```

### Điểm đã làm đúng

- `QListView` virtualization — **giữ**
- `ThumbnailManager` decode worker thread + LRU + disk cache
- Prefetch chunked; list `_scroll_busy` 120ms defer
- `pipeline_row_paint.py` shared helpers; list thumb DPR-aware
- `interaction_fast_paint` khi rubber-band (band-aid tạm thời)

