### 5.6 QML module layout (`monostudio/ui_qt/qml/pipeline/`)

| File QML | Vai trò |
|----------|---------|
| `qmldir` | Module `Monos.Pipeline` |
| `PipelineTheme.qml` | Singleton — colors từ `MONOS_COLORS` (sync token Python) |
| `PipelineGridView.qml` | `GridView` + card delegate |
| `PipelineListView.qml` | `ListView` + sticky header row (hoặc 2-column Flickable) |
